{"id":"b90047664466f5b8","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-incompleteness-schema.md","title":"不完备性结论模式","display":"df-incompleteness-schema — 不完备性结论模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-incompleteness-schema","aliases":["18-df-incompleteness-schema","18-df-002"],"display":"df-incompleteness-schema — 不完备性结论模式","depends_on":["[[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]","[[18-df-provable]]","[[18-df-sentence]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"1 Historical Background","source_printed_pages":"3","source_pdf_pages":"14","source_correspondence":"conclusion-schema-only","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-incompleteness-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-incompleteness-schema</span><span>18-df-002</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incompleteness-schema — 不完备性结论模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ad4722aacf87aee1\" href=\"?note=ad4722aacf87aee1\" title=\"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface\">18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1 Historical Background"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"14"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"conclusion-schema-only"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 为下式引入的谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad4722aacf87aee1\" href=\"?note=ad4722aacf87aee1\" title=\"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface\">18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface</a>；本节点定义结论模式，不将其作为对任意T成立的不完备性定理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}G)\\land\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\neg G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}G)\\land\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\neg G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\to\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\to\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§1 印刷p3回顾 Gödel 定理。这里保存原笔记的条件结论模式，同时单列实际句法不完备谓词；没有为任意T证明该条件。要得到不完备性定理，还需有效公理化、足够算术强度及具体可证性条件，不可由此定义自动推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface","status":"resolved","id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"9cea4880793901f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"20cb1a93869734ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"9cea4880793901f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 见 [[18-df-sentence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"20cb1a93869734ac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 见 [[18-df-sentence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface","status":"resolved","id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}$、$\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}$ 为下式引入的谓词；$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)$ 见 [[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]；本节点定义结论模式，不将其作为对任意T成立的不完备性定理。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}G)\\land\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\neg G)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\to\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}(T)).","display":true}],"bytes":1745,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-incompleteness-schema]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-incompleteness-schema]]"}],"outgoing":["ad4722aacf87aee1","9cea4880793901f3","20cb1a93869734ac"]}